model se
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2.1 (#241), the mutation run's survivors: what a place takes from movements stated same (L §6.1, §8.1; P43 on #241): (H) legs of different names and amounts; (J) one side dated by a stated hole, different amounts"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind paid: event certain
  leg pay: PLN

place wal_h: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place wal_j: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input dh: date
input dj: date
input d7: date
input a1: money PLN
input a2: money PLN
input b1: money PLN
input c2: money PLN

move h1: transfers
  on dh
  leg cash from world to wal_h amount a1

move h2: paid
  on dh
  leg pay from world to wal_h amount a2

move j1: transfers
  on dj
  leg cash from world to wal_j amount b1

move j2: transfers
  on d7
  leg cash from world to wal_j amount c2

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  opening[wal_h] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[wal_j] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  dh = 2026-03-05 "s"
  d7 = 2026-03-07 "s"
  dj = ?"which day is j1?" "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  a2 = 120.00 PLN "s"
  b1 = 50.00 PLN "s"
  c2 = 60.00 PLN "s"

version later
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-05-01
  same h1 = h2
  same j1 = j2

ask h_bal: bal(wal_h, 2026-03-31)
ask j_bal: bal(wal_j, 2026-03-31)
